Read AGENTS.md at the repo root before changing anything. The short version:

- Game rewards are decided by SQL functions in supabase/migrations; never trust the client. New migrations only, never edit applied ones.
- Original creatures only: no Pokémon names, art or trade dress.
- On-chain scripts: DRY_RUN=1, then devnet, then mainnet. Never commit or print keys or .env. Positions and treasury are owned by the Squads multisigs, never the operator wallet.
- Launch numbers live in scripts/liquidity/config.ts and must match the public disclosure; change both together.
